{"id":"2c68778d3c902ef0","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-special-proper-low2.md","title":"特殊有效闭类有真 low₂ 的 HIF 成员","display":"thm-special-proper-low2 — 特殊有效闭类有真 low₂ 的 HIF 成员","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-special-proper-low2","aliases":["20-thm-special-proper-low2"],"display":"thm-special-proper-low2 — 特殊有效闭类有真 low₂ 的 HIF 成员","chapter":"9","section":"9.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 9.5.1 后的明确推论","source_printed_pages":[179],"source_pdf_pages":[211],"depends_on":["[[20-df-special-class]]","[[20-df-proper-lown]]","[[20-thm-hif-low2-basis]]","[[20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-special-proper-low2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-special-proper-low2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-special-proper-low2 — 特殊有效闭类有真 low₂ 的 HIF 成员"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.5.1 后的明确推论"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>179</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6cfefe696c9c5cc\" href=\"?note=e6cfefe696c9c5cc\" title=\"20-df-proper-lown\">20-df-proper-lown</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76ff789378ca2b77\" href=\"?note=76ff789378ca2b77\" title=\"20-thm-hif-low2-basis\">20-thm-hif-low2-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9d3b071b7008d27\" href=\"?note=c9d3b071b7008d27\" title=\"20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable\">20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Special}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Special}(C)\\)</span>，即非空有效闭类且无可计算成员。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e6cfefe696c9c5cc\" href=\"?note=e6cfefe696c9c5cc\" title=\"20-df-proper-lown\">20-df-proper-lown</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76ff789378ca2b77\" href=\"?note=76ff789378ca2b77\" title=\"20-thm-hif-low2-basis\">20-thm-hif-low2-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c9d3b071b7008d27\" href=\"?note=c9d3b071b7008d27\" title=\"20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable\">20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special-proper-low2}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\\land\\operatorname{ProperLow}_2(X)\\land X\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special-proper-low2}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\\land\\operatorname{ProperLow}_2(X)\\land X\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>HIF–low₂ 基给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。特殊性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 非可计算，故它与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 不可比；若它 low₁，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\le_T X\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\">\\(X\\le_T X\\prime\\equiv_T0\\prime\\)</span> 又矛盾。因此是真 low₂，且该真层使用全体 oracle 的定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.5.1 后的明确推论；印刷页 179；PDF 第 211 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-proper-lown","status":"resolved","id":"e6cfefe696c9c5cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-proper-lown]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hif-low2-basis","status":"resolved","id":"76ff789378ca2b77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-hif-low2-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable","status":"resolved","id":"c9d3b071b7008d27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-proper-lown]]；see [[20-thm-hif-low2-basis]]；see [[20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-proper-lown","status":"resolved","id":"e6cfefe696c9c5cc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-proper-lown]]；see [[20-thm-hif-low2-basis]]；see [[20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hi